{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n こんにちは。\n \n \n \n \n \n 昨日は東京は雪が降りました。\n 朝起きたら積もっててびっくりしたー。⛄️\n \n \n まだまだ寒いの続きそうね〜\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 先日、姫(なーこちゃん)と\n 鎌倉に行きました。\n \n \n 夕方くらいから唐突に初鎌倉した。🌅\n \n \n \n \n \n チェキを持っていったから、\n ずーっと姫の撮影会してた。\n \n いつも撮らせてくれてありがとう〜\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFN7PH0K7H243HA0PX640","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFP7FJKKEYK9XYMJ2SG1D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFQ73S2WJE1CYTYCC5XTH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFR6EGWT84K7VX6MMGMEJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n ひたすらに癒しだった、、🌅🌅\n 優しくて心があったかくなるねー。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 姫も撮ってくれてた!ありがとう〜\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFS6R17F8R5ZJJGNXF31H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n (撮られてるの気づいてる顔😑)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFT677NDG5RRK2EC9PDTM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFV5A99227Y6JGTDP4GZA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n どっひゃーーーー\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 読んでくれてありがとうね。\n 長濱ねる"}],"source":"archive"}